#. Description of the plugin
#: sonoquill.php
msgid "Turns a fact script, a post or a custom source into a finished podcast episode: speaking script via language model, number and fact checking, speech synthesis with your own voice clone, assembly, mastering and a Podlove draft — with two human approvals."
msgstr ""

